 "_about": [
  "Hand-curated puzzles for the years CShapes does not reach outside Europe, drawn from historical-basemaps snapshots (GPL-3.0, commit da7a4b7).",
  "draw: snapshot feature NAME (or NAME@lon,lat for one of several features with that name) mapped to the label shown; null keeps the fill but shows no label. Features not listed are drawn as land with no unit.",
  "facts: dated statements about what the map shows. A fact with 'from' holds from that day; one with 'to' holds through that day. The window runs from the latest 'from' to the earliest 'to'; the facts that set the two ends are the tells. '{when}' in a text becomes the date. Every fact has a source.",
  "historical-basemaps snapshots are not consistent to the year (the 1815 file draws the 1846 Oregon line and New Spain, which ended in 1821). Each crop here was checked so that everything it shows fits one window; crops that could not be made consistent were left out."
 ],
